    "descriptionEn": "A chemistry name for the Japanese members of tripleS: <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 201, 53);\">카에데</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0);\">코토네</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118);\">마유</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(172, 98, 183);\">린</span>. 일본즈 is the everyday name, but for something cuter people also say <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 201, 53);\">카</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0);\">코</span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118);\">마</span><span style=\"color: rgb(172, 98, 183);\">린</span>. <br>"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">When </span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">마유</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> joined the foreign-member room that </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 201, 53); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">카에데</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 149, 63); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">니엔</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> already shared at Cookie House HAUS, they called themselves the strongest foreigners — coined on </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 116, 120); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">231212 SIGNAL LIVE</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">. Later </span><span style=\"color: rgb(172, 98, 183); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> 린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> joined as the last member of the 최강외국인즈 room.</span>"
