  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">서연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(152, 242, 29); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">채연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(219, 12, 116); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">유연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">하연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">지연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> — a naturally formed chemistry for five whose names end in '연'. After the original '</span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">쓰</span><span style=\"color: rgb(152, 242, 29); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">리</span><span style=\"color: rgb(219, 12, 116); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">', </span><span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">S19 정하연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">S24 지서연</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> were added and 오연즈 appeared as well.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\">지우</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(213, 19, 19);\">신위</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187);\">하연</span> are all into acting; <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\">지우 is currently in Dongguk University's theater department</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187);\">하연이</span> has said that when she goes to college she wants to follow <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\">지우</span> into an acting-related major."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(146, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">혜린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(172, 98, 183); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(123, 186, 141); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">설린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(207, 243, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">해린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(207, 243, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">서아</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">) — a chemistry name for the four whose names end in '린'.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">S</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">1</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">S1</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">1</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(199, 163, 224);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">S2</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">1</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> — members whose reveal numbers end in '1'.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 116, 120); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">240501 tripleS 2nd-anniversary SIGNAL LIVE</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> set the name.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">Dad </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">이지우</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> and mom </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">공유빈</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, with daughter </span><span style=\"color: rgb(183, 245, 76); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">주빈</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> — that's the bit.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">Seeing how </span><span style=\"color: rgb(183, 245, 76); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">주빈</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">'s face resembles both of them, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> WAV</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">s started calling them 가족즈,</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">and the three liked it enough to start using it themselves, making it the official chemistry name.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "descriptionEn": "On <span style=\"color: rgb(50, 237, 253);\">250226 SIGNAL LIVE</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226);\">유빈</span> and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span> did a duet live and coined a chemistry name for the two whose MBTIs start with IST. \r\nBut via <span style=\"color: rgb(219, 12, 116);\">250303 지우의 fromm</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\"> 지우</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226);\">유빈</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span> said that while eating late-night snacks they decided to fold iced-tea-loving <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\"> 지우</span> into 아이스티즈 too, turning it into a three-person chemistry. \r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226);\">유빈</span> and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span> then picked 원플원즈 as their new duo name."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "descriptionEn": "Combines the '<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\">쥬</span>' nickname for <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\">이지우</span>, the '<span style=\"color: rgb(183, 245, 76);\">주</span>' in <span style=\"color: rgb(183, 245, 76);\">주빈</span>, and '<span style=\"color: rgb(123, 186, 141);\">라다 분락사</span>' from <span style=\"color: rgb(123, 186, 141);\">설린</span>'s Thai full name<span style=\"color: rgb(123, 186, 141);\"> 피라다 분락사</span>.\r\n\r\nSet on <span style=\"color: rgb(50, 237, 253);\">250410 SIGNAL LIVE</span>."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "descriptionEn": "If you line them up <span style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 19, 19);\">신위</span>-&gt;<span style=\"color: rgb(183, 245, 76);\">주빈</span>-&gt;<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255);\">서연</span>-&gt;<span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118);\">마유</span>, they look like a Wi-Fi signal — hence the chemistry. Confirmed on <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 221, 0);\">250614 SIGNAL</span>."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "descriptionEn": "An eight-member chemistry of <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255);\">서연</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(103, 153, 160);\">나경</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 154, 214);\">다현</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 149, 63);\">니엔</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(183, 245, 76);\">주빈</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187);\">하연</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(123, 186, 141);\">설린</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(207, 243, 255);\">서아</span> — the members who went on tripleS's first overseas tour.<br>That first overseas tour wasn't a unit tour and didn't have a separate name,<br>and on <span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 93, 121);\">250703 서연이의 COSMO LIVE</span> Seoyeon herself said they are 컴트루즈."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "descriptionEn": "A chemistry name from tripleS's own content (3)인의 식탁: <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 66, 138);\">bread-loving 시온</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 154, 214);\">noodle-loving 다현</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255);\">tteok-loving 서연</span>.<br><br><br><br>"
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "descriptionEn": "<span>Coined during a behind-the-scenes shoot for Japanese hair-dye brand </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 171, 98);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ULTIST</span></span><span>, which has an exclusive deal with tripleS. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 248, 0);\">지우</span><span>, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(172, 98, 183);\">린</span><span>, and </span><span style=\"color:rgb(123, 186, 141);\">설린</span><span> shot under an ice-cream ULTIST concept, and Jiwoo named the chemistry.</span><br><br><span><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 116, 120);\"> 261021 SIGNAL</span> confirms it. </span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(201, 220, 228);\">261016 Andless comeback SIGNAL LIVE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> — 빙칠링 is the Chinese pronunciation of ice cream, and it sounds similar when you mash the three names </span><span style=\"color:rgb(183, 245, 76);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">주</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(183, 245, 76);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">빈</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">), (</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(213, 19, 19);\">신</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(213, 19, 19);\">위</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(123, 186, 141);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">설</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(123, 186, 141);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">린</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">). </span>\r\n<br>\r\n<br><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">These three are also </span><span style=\"color:rgb(254, 142, 118);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">tripleS's English leads</span><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 233, 234);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span>"
  },
