  {
    "id": 40,
    "descriptionEn": "<span><span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 229, 102);\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">tripleS is a 24-member multinational girl group under MODHAUS</span></span></span>. From 2022 they revealed members one by one and drew major attention in K-POP with the world's first <span>'fan-participatory girl group'</span> system.</span>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>The name means 'Social Sonyo Seoul' (social girls living in Seoul), weaving the stories of ordinary-yet-special girls who live in today's Seoul with their phones into the music and lore.</span><br><span><br></span><br><span>DIMENSION:</span><span>tripleS's biggest trait is that they never stay fixed — they keep forming new unit combinations called DIMENSIONS.</span><br><span><br></span><br><span><span><span>Gravity:<span>Fans use the dedicated app </span><span>COSMO</span><span> to vote (Gravity) and directly assemble and name who goes into each DIMENSION</span></span><span>.</span></span></span><br><span><span><br></span></span><br><span><span><span>Signature tracks:</span> city-pop/dance-leaning <em>'Generation'</em>, the 10-member era song <em>'Rising'</em>, and <em>'Girls Never Die'</em>, which gave the full 24 their first music-show win.</span></span><br><span><br></span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(152, 242, 29); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">채연이</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\"> got hooked after a friend showed her shorts about the 아라아라 meme, then shared it with roommates </span><span style=\"color: rgb(146, 0, 255); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">혜린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">코토네</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\"> until it spread like a trend and they named the room the 아라아라 Hawaii room. Members of that room are called </span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">아라아라즈.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\">&nbsp;Later </span><span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187);\">하연이</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\"> joined Moda Forest HAUS and the 아라아라 Hawaii room as an added member.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\"> More on </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 116, 120);\">231115 SIGNAL LIVE</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\">.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "descriptionEn": "<span>'한림즈' is the chemistry name for members who attended Hallym Arts High School while in tripleS.</span><br><span>It started in March 2023 when </span><span style=\"color: rgb(146, 0, 255);\">정혜린</span><span> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(252, 131, 164);\">김수민</span><span> enrolled, then became four in December that year when already-enrolled </span><span style=\"color: rgb(172, 98, 183);\">린</span><span> and newly revealed </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 66, 138);\"> 박시온</span><span> joined the public lineup. Later </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 116, 255);\">곽연지</span><span> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(199, 163, 224);\"> 김채원</span><span>, who had been at regular high schools, transferred in and completed the six-member chemistry.</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 154, 214);\">서다현</span><span> also went to Hallym Arts High but debuted after graduating, so she usually isn't counted in '한림즈'. In 2026 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(207, 243, 255);\">서아</span><span> entered Hallym Arts High's applied music department as </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 154, 214);\">서다현</span><span>'s direct underclassman, but after the '07 members (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(146, 0, 255);\">정혜린</span><span>, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(252, 131, 164);\">김수민</span><span>, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(199, 163, 224);\">김채원</span><span>) graduated, the name isn't used much anymore.</span>"
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "descriptionEn": "A chemistry name from tripleS's own content (3)인의 식탁.<br>Candidates like 유채채, 채채유, 채유채 and more were on the table, but on-site voting picked 코김딸즈.<br>It means <span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118);\">코우마 마유</span> plus <span style=\"color: rgb(152, 242, 29);\">김채연</span>'s <span style=\"color: rgb(199, 163, 224);\">딸(기공주) 김채원</span>.<br><br>"
  },
